## 3. Unified Risk Tiers & Plan Review Sign-Off (`Q8`, `Q13`)

Test case risk tiers and plan-review findings use strictly **`BLOCKER` / `MAJOR` / `MINOR`** (`shared_contracts/flags_and_statuses.md`; never use legacy numbered priority labels):

| Plan Review State | Plan Verdict | Action Required |
|---|---|---|
| **Untestable AC (`Q2`), unmapped AC (`Q3`), missing `Role × Scope` / `SR14` case (`Q4`), or vague expectation (`Q11`)** | **`BLOCKER` Finding** | Block test execution; resolve spec question or add missing case |
| **Missing validation/state/boundary/regression case (`Q4`, `Q9`, `Q10`), wrong test level (`Q5`), or unlabelled stub (`Q7`)** | **`MAJOR` Finding** | Revise test plan before execution sign-off |
| **Formatting, ordering, or minor wording improvements** | **`MINOR` Finding** | Plan approved for execution; update inline |

